       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRANSACT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT.
           ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE.
           DISPLAY "TRANSACTION ACCEPTED".
           DISPLAY "NEW BALANCE: " WS-BALANCE.
           STOP RUN.
